cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use scSidekick in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "scSidekick: A Single-Cell and Spatial Transcriptomics Toolkit"
abstract: >-
  An R toolkit for single-cell RNA-seq, spatial transcriptomics (Visium and
  Visium HD), and bulk expression analysis. Provides publication-ready
  visualization (dot plots, UMAP grids, feature maps, spatial plots), pathway
  analysis (GSEA, pseudobulk GSEA, ssGSEA, over-representation, leading-edge),
  CellChat cell-cell communication wrappers, copy-number inference (inferCNV,
  CopyKAT), consensus NMF, gene co-expression, and Kaplan-Meier survival
  analysis for TCGA and bulk cohorts, together with automatic figure legends,
  JSON parameter logs, and a PowerPoint report builder. Designed to work
  seamlessly with Seurat.
